-- Unification termination regression (SHOULD SUCCEED).
-- Feeding the same unknown-typed value to parameters typed `Pair OF a, b`
-- and `Pair OF b, a` is well-typed (with a = b). The unifier used to build
-- the cyclic substitution a := b, b := a here and hang forever while
-- applying the substitution.
DECLARE Pair OF a, b
  HAS fst IS AN a
      snd IS A  b

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
      b IS A TYPE
      p IS A Pair OF a, b
      q IS A Pair OF b, a
GIVETH A Pair OF a, b
swappy p q MEANS p

ASSUME mystery

oops MEANS swappy mystery mystery
